// and a signed no-return clause is the thing keeping it shut.
Q.culture_crisis_left_pivotal =
    Q.culture_crisis_gap > 0 &&
    !(Q.united_right_return_blocked != 1 &&
        Q.culture_crisis_without_left + Q.culture_crisis_right_reserve >= majority)
        ? 1 : 0;
// Who at the cabinet table would sign the motion. PSL and Konfederacja have no
// objection they would spend anything on; Poland 2050 in the Council of
// Ministers is a standing one.
let partnerWillingness = 1;
if (Q.ministry_psl_in_cabinet) partnerWillingness += 1;
if (Q.ministry_konf_in_cabinet) partnerWillingness += 1;
if (Q.ministry_p2050_in_cabinet) partnerWillingness -= 1;
Q.culture_crisis_appointment_possible = partnerWillingness >= 1 ? 1 : 0;
Q.culture_crisis_discomfort = Math.round(
    (Number(Q.razem_dissent) || 0) * 0.4 +
    (Number(Q.progressives_dissent) || 0) * 0.4 +
    (Number(Q.coalition_blur) || 0) * 0.5
);
Q.public_mood_pending_lgbt_equality_salience += 12;
Q.public_mood_pending_secular_state_salience += 10;
Q.news_headline =
    "PiS asks for a deputy premiership for Przemysław Czarnek";
!}

= June 2026 — The bill for the majority

This has to be said plainly before anything else in this room is discussed,
because everybody in it already knows it and the pretending is what makes the
decision worse.

For a very large number of our own people, this arrangement has been intolerable
since the day it was signed. Not disappointing — intolerable. We have spent two
and a half years governing with the party that built the Tribunal, ran the
prosecution service as an instrument, and organised two general elections
against the existence of people our own deputies represent. The internal
temperature reads **[+ razem_dissent : dissent +]** in Razem and **[+
progressives_dissent : dissent +]** among the progressives, and those numbers
have never once fallen for longer than a quarter.

The defence has always been the same and has always been real: a floor under
wages, services and households that no other available majority would have
built, and a written contract with **[+ formation_pis_left_safeguards +]**
enforceable
[? if formation_pis_left_safeguards = 1: safeguard?][? if formation_pis_left_safeguards != 1: safeguards?]
in it.

Now the bill arrives.

**[+ prime_minister +]** proposes **Przemysław Czarnek** as Deputy Prime
Minister with a coordinating brief over education, culture and family policy —
sitting above our ministers in the order of the Council of Ministers, chairing
the cabinet committee that clears their circulars.

- @culture_crisis_names: Read the nomination and the arithmetic

@culture_crisis_names
title: The nomination
on-arrival: {!
Q.news_headline =
    "Czarnek's nomination puts the cross-bloc contract in front of its own signatories";
!}

= The man and the rank

**Przemysław Czarnek** was Minister of Education and Science from 2020 to 2023.
The record is not contested by anyone, including him. He introduced **HiT**, the
history-and-present subject whose commissioned textbook explained in-vitro
conception in the language of breeding. He ran **Willa Plus**, the capital-grant
programme whose list of beneficiaries turned out to be heavily populated by
organisations connected to his own camp and to the Church. He threatened
university funding over events he disapproved of. And in 2019, on public
television, he said of LGBT people that they are not equal to normal people —
a sentence this party has read into the Sejm record more than once, because our
own deputies are in the category he was describing.

He is not being offered a portfolio. He is being offered **rank**: a deputy
premiership and a committee chair through which our ministers' own instruments
would pass. The distinction matters, because there is no ministry we could
trade to make it smaller.

Why now is not a mystery either. PiS gave up Solidarna Polska to make this
cabinet — **[+ culture_crisis_walkout_seats +] deputies**, the prosecution
service and its entire right flank — and has spent thirty months being told by
Ziobro from outside that it sold the programme for a majority. The leadership
needs one appointment that proves otherwise, and it has to be an appointment we
would hate. That is not a side effect of the choice. It is the specification.

= What our votes are worth this week

The cabinet parties hold **[+ culture_crisis_cabinet_seats +]** seats of **[+
sejm_total +]**. Ours are **[+ culture_crisis_left_seats +]**. Without us the
cabinet has **[+ culture_crisis_without_left +]**, against a majority of **[+
culture_crisis_majority +]**.

[? if culture_crisis_gap > 0: They are **[+ culture_crisis_gap +]** short.?]
[? if culture_crisis_gap = 0: They are not short, which means everything we say
this week is a request.?]

The bloc that could close that gap is the one this coalition was assembled out
of the wreckage of: Suwerenna Polska's **[+ culture_crisis_walkout_seats +]**
and Konfederacja's **[+ culture_crisis_konf_seats +]**, **[+
culture_crisis_right_reserve +]** between them.

[? if united_right_return_blocked = 1: The contract we signed in December 2023
forbids readmitting the walkout deputies to the governing majority without our
consent. For as long as that clause stands, the reserve is not available and our
votes are the only ones that make this a government.?]
[? if united_right_return_blocked != 1: We never asked for a clause against
their return, and nobody volunteered one. Reassembling the United Right is a
telephone call and a press conference, and everyone at Thursday's table has
already worked out whether the numbers reach.?]

[? if culture_crisis_appointment_possible = 1: [? if ministry_konf_in_cabinet = 1:
Konfederacja already sits in this cabinet and regards the nomination as overdue.?]
[? if ministry_psl_in_cabinet = 1: PSL will not spend anything to stop it; its
deputies did not come into politics to defend the equality clauses.?]
[? if ministry_psl_in_cabinet = 0 and ministry_konf_in_cabinet = 0: No partner at
this table has an institutional objection and the standing to press it.?]
The motion is available if we do not make it expensive.?]
[? if culture_crisis_appointment_possible = 0: Poland 2050 sits in this Council
of Ministers and will not put its ministers' names on the motion. **[+
prime_minister +]** cannot present what his own cabinet will not clear, which
means the nomination is a briefing — and our red line, if we draw one, will be
free and will look far braver than it was.?]

**[+ pis_leader +]** wants an answer before Thursday's coalition council.

- @cc_block
- @cc_piontkowski
- @cc_veto
- @cc_abstain

