= The nomination does not reach the President

We do it in the committee, not on television, and we do it with the text: the
equality and institutional clauses, the procedure attached to them, and the
arithmetic of what happens to this cabinet on the day we stop signing.

The nomination is withdrawn before it is formally submitted, and **[+
prime_minister +]** is left to explain to a party congress why the man his base
wanted is not in the cabinet. He explains it by blaming us, which is accurate
and which we accept.

The culture current does not get smaller for having lost. It gets angrier, and
it now has the single most useful thing an internal opposition can own: proof
that the leadership will refuse its own electorate to keep this partner.

- @poland_event_queue: Leave the committee

@cc_piontkowski
title: Concede the rank and choose who fills it
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Give the leadership its promotion and put a departmental administrator in it instead of a movement.
