@czarnek_appointment_2026
# prose-audit: Grade A — The swearing-in is a scene, the arithmetic of a Left departure is computed against the United Right PiS could rebuild, and both branches carry their real price: an internal injury this party may not survive, or a cabinet whose next majority is the coalition we joined to prevent.
title: Czarnek is sworn in
subtitle: A deputy premiership over education, culture and family policy, in a Council of Ministers containing this party
face-image: img/poland/events/presidential-palace-interior.webp
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.czarnek_office_outcome = "czarnek";
Q.czarnek_in_government = 1;
