= The cabinet holds

Our ministers do not resign. The statement is four sentences long and every one
is about the programme: the wage floor, the housing budget, the service
guarantees. The word *Czarnek* does not appear in it, which is the first thing
every journalist notices and the only thing any of them report.

The government survives, and so does everything the compact was joined for. That
was always a real reason. It will be worth in two years exactly what it is worth
today, and not one thing more.

Razem's council meets the same night and does not invite the leadership. The
Wiosna deputies hold their own meeting and brief afterwards without a common
line. The PPS current publishes the 2019 quotation beside our four sentences on
one page. Our equality deputies are still being asked the question on camera,
and now they are being asked it as members of a party that decided the answer
did not require an action.

The membership figures will show it in September. We have spent two and a half
years arguing that a floor under wages was worth the photographs. This is the
photograph that the argument does not cover.

- @poland_event_queue: Publish the four sentences

