Q.news_headline =
    "A PiS minority counts its votes and the Left decides what its own are worth";
!}

= The reserve on the right

[? if government_minority = 1: **[+ culture_crisis_gap +]** votes have to be
found for every bill, every appointment and the 2027 budget. Suwerenna Polska
holds **[+ culture_crisis_walkout_seats +]** and Konfederacja **[+
culture_crisis_konf_seats +]**. Together that is **[+
culture_crisis_right_reserve +]**, and reassembling it does not require anybody
to change a single position.?]
[? if government_minority = 0: The cabinet does not need our votes to survive.
It will need them for anything above a bare majority, and it will need our
voters in 2027, which is a slower kind of arithmetic.?]

[? if united_right_return_blocked = 1: Our December 2023 no-return clause is
still in the contract. A contract we are no longer a party to.?]
[? if united_right_return_blocked != 1: There was never a clause against their
return. There was never a reason for PiS to offer one, and we never asked.?]

- @pis_posture_supply
- @pis_posture_snap
- @pis_posture_dare

