    70, (Number(Q.early_election_risk) || 0) + 22
);
Q.government_coalition_dissent += 12;
Q.government_minority = 1;
Q.coalition_status = "PiS minority facing a Left dissolution demand";
Q.progressive_credibility += 10;
Q.party_unity += 5;
Q.razem_cooperation += 8;
Q.left_poll_momentum += 0.35;
Q.pis_relation -= 10;
Q.institutional_trust -= 2;
Q.news_headline =
    "The Left refuses supply and moves for the dissolution of the Sejm";
!}

We say the clean thing: a government that swore in this Deputy Prime Minister
has no mandate for him, the mandate belongs to voters, and we supply nothing
until they have been asked.

The constitution answers within the day. Self-dissolution needs **307 of 460**,
which is more than every party currently willing to vote for one; the other
route runs through a budget this cabinet has not yet failed to pass. We have not
brought an election closer. We have made every party in the building state on the
record whether it wants one, and the ones that say no now have to explain what
they are protecting.

- @poland_event_queue: Move the dissolution resolution

@pis_posture_dare
title: Refuse to be its floor and let it go back to the people it left
subtitle: Clean, consistent, and it hands the arithmetic to Ziobro and Mentzen. Everything after this is PiS's choice and our responsibility.
on-arrival: {!
Q.left_pis_minority_posture = "No floor";
Q.government_minority = 1;
Q.coalition_status = "PiS minority with no reliable majority";
Q.konf_normalisation = (Number(Q.konf_normalisation) || 0) + 8;
Q.far_right_agenda += 8;
Q.early_election_risk += 12;
Q.government_coalition_dissent += 16;
// A cabinet that is short and has been refused a floor goes back to the bloc it
// gave up to build this one. Reopening it is PiS's act; refusing to be the
// alternative is ours.
if (Q.culture_crisis_gap > 0 &&
    (Number(Q.culture_crisis_without_left) || 0) +
        (Number(Q.culture_crisis_right_reserve) || 0) >=
        (Number(Q.culture_crisis_majority) || 231)) {
    Q.united_right_line_reopened = 1;
    Q.pis_konf_coalition_available = 1;
    Q.psl_konf_partner_line = Q.psl_konf_partner_line == "closed"
        ? "conditional" : Q.psl_konf_partner_line;
}
Q.party_unity += 6;
Q.progressive_credibility += 12;
Q.razem_cooperation += 10;
Q.left_poll_momentum += 0.25;
Q.pis_relation -= 14;
Q.institutional_trust -= 4;
Q.minority_safety -= 4;
Q.news_headline = Q.united_right_line_reopened
    ? "PiS reopens talks with Ziobro and Konfederacja after the Left refuses to be its floor"
    : "The Left refuses to be a PiS minority's floor";
!}

We refuse the role of the opposition that governs without offices. No standing
arrangement, no advance guarantees, no bill-by-bill price list. They wanted a
cabinet with him in it; they can have one, and they can find its majority.

[? if united_right_line_reopened = 1: They find it where it has been sitting
since December 2023. Within a fortnight the negotiators are meeting Suwerenna
Polska and Konfederacja about the autumn calendar, and the meetings are described
as technical. **[+ culture_crisis_without_left +]** plus **[+
culture_crisis_right_reserve +]** clears **[+ culture_crisis_majority +]**. The
United Right reassembles, larger on its right than the one that lost in 2023,
and the thirty months in which we held a floor under wages inside it become the
reason it was able to.?]
[? if united_right_line_reopened = 1 and united_right_return_blocked = 1: Our
no-return clause is quoted at the press conference, by a journalist, as a
curiosity. It bound a contract that we ended.?]
[? if united_right_line_reopened = 0: They do not find it. The arithmetic does
not close even with both of them, so the cabinet governs by improvisation and
the autumn budget becomes the date everything is aimed at.?]

We are clean, we are consistent, and we have made ourselves irrelevant to what
happens between now and the budget. Whether that was the right price depends
entirely on what walks through the door we refused to hold shut.

- @poland_event_queue: Refuse the arrangement
